@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

Actor User as user USER_COLOR
Participant ":UI" as ui UI_COLOR
Participant ":Logic" as logic LOGIC_COLOR
Participant "live:Model" as model MODEL_COLOR
Participant "pending:Model" as pending MODEL_COLOR
Participant ":Storage" as storage STORAGE_COLOR

user -[USER_COLOR]> ui : "delete i/A0123456B"
activate ui UI_COLOR
ui -[UI_COLOR]> logic : execute("delete i/A0123456B")
activate logic LOGIC_COLOR
note over logic
Parse the command; reject if startup loading failed.
Capture a copy of the live AddressBook for undo.
end note
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> model : read current records, preferences, and filter
model --[MODEL_COLOR]> logic : current state
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> pending : copy current state
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> pending : deletePerson(student with matching ID)
pending --[MODEL_COLOR]> logic : proposed records
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> storage : saveAddressBook(proposed records)
activate storage STORAGE_COLOR
storage -[STORAGE_COLOR]> storage : lock, write temporary file, check external changes, replace atomically
alt save succeeds
storage --[STORAGE_COLOR]> logic : saved
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> logic : retain predecessor snapshot if records changed (up to 100)
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> model : publish proposed records and filter
logic -[LOGIC_COLOR]> logic : clear displayedAttendance
logic --[LOGIC_COLOR]> ui : deletion success
ui --[UI_COLOR]> user : updated student list and feedback
else save fails
storage --[STORAGE_COLOR]> logic : IOException (including file changed, file in use, or storage location failure)
logic --[LOGIC_COLOR]> ui : CommandException
ui --[UI_COLOR]> user : mapped save error message
note over model
Live records and filter remain unchanged.
Undo history and any open attendance report remain unchanged.
end note
end
deactivate storage
deactivate logic
deactivate ui
@enduml
